    "detailed_description": "<strong>Solve Puzzles!</strong><br><br>In logik, you can solve many chill &amp; challenging puzzles of varying difficulty. Puzzles are organized into sections, each with unique color schemes. <br><br><strong>Puzzle Types</strong><br><br>There are two types of puzzles that are playable: regular and slide levels. Regular levels have scenarios where the player must move the striped block out of the puzzle area. Slide levels start with the striped block being mis-aligned to the exit, allowing the player to <i>slide </i>the striped block, with other blocks, in line with the exit.<br><br><strong>An Extra Challenge</strong><br><br>If you\u2019re looking for an extra challenge on top of the rest of the challenging puzzles, there is <i>Challenge Mode!</i> Challenge Mode is a way to escape the main sections and try something\u2026well, a little more difficult<br><br><strong>Is this game for you?</strong><br><br>If you are unsure if this game is for you, take this quick test below!<br><br>1. Puzzle<br>2. Challenging<br>3. Chill/Relaxing<br>4. Stylized Graphics<br>5. Atmospheric<br><br>If you like some of these genres, you will probably like logik!<br><br>(Note: This game and descriptions are subject to change. <strong>Nothing is final yet.</strong>)",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Solve Puzzles!</strong><br><br>In logik, you can solve many chill &amp; challenging puzzles of varying difficulty. Puzzles are organized into sections, each with unique color schemes. <br><br><strong>Puzzle Types</strong><br><br>There are two types of puzzles that are playable: regular and slide levels. Regular levels have scenarios where the player must move the striped block out of the puzzle area. Slide levels start with the striped block being mis-aligned to the exit, allowing the player to <i>slide </i>the striped block, with other blocks, in line with the exit.<br><br><strong>An Extra Challenge</strong><br><br>If you\u2019re looking for an extra challenge on top of the rest of the challenging puzzles, there is <i>Challenge Mode!</i> Challenge Mode is a way to escape the main sections and try something\u2026well, a little more difficult<br><br><strong>Is this game for you?</strong><br><br>If you are unsure if this game is for you, take this quick test below!<br><br>1. Puzzle<br>2. Challenging<br>3. Chill/Relaxing<br>4. Stylized Graphics<br>5. Atmospheric<br><br>If you like some of these genres, you will probably like logik!<br><br>(Note: This game and descriptions are subject to change. <strong>Nothing is final yet.</strong>)",
